  "description": {
   "en": "While on a date with his favorite idol, Natsumi, a vocational school student, encounters his favorite idol, Oujirou, who has secretly appeared at the scene.\nHe ends up spilling his drink on Oujirou!\nOujirou tries to take off his hat and sunglasses without caring that there are fans all around, and Natsumi panics and drags him back to his house──!?\nA heart-warming BL story about a young handsome actor and a vocational school student who wants to be XXX with his favorite idol☆\n\nThis work is a compilation of Akihaya's \"Am I being kissed by my favorite idol right now?\" from the \"Gachikoi BL Comic Anthology.\""
  },
